      "reason": "High thermal stability, flexibility, and chemical resistance for field deployment"
    },
    {
      "part": "Micro-textured surface",
      "material": "Silica-coated PDMS (polydimethylsiloxane)",
      "reason": "Tunable wettability and biocompatibility; enables hydrophobic/hydrophilic patterning"
    },
    {
      "part": "Photonic crystal arrays",
