  "expected_performance": "Achieve adaptive camouflage with dynamic reflectance modulation across visible (400–700 nm) and near-IR (700–1400 nm) spectra under varying ambient humidity (20–90% RH) and light conditions. Response time < 15 seconds with > 90% background mimicry accuracy in controlled testing.",
